    {"type":"text","id":"adr_note","x":1400,"y":880,"width":680,"height":80,"text":"Key ADRs:\n  ADR 0001 — Composition is the declarative doc (derived state; no raw JSON from model)\n  ADR 0002 — Neutral IR: three layer kinds (media|text|audio); backends never branch on overlay type\n  ADR 0003 — Three-service pipeline: Media → Authoring → Render\n  ADR 0004 — Tool-use authoring loop with bounded op budget\n  ADR 0007 — Vision adapter: sighted vs blind LLM clients (consult_placement)","originalText":"Key ADRs:\n  ADR 0001 — Composition is the declarative doc (derived state; no raw JSON from model)\n  ADR 0002 — Neutral IR: three layer kinds (media|text|audio); backends never branch on overlay type\n  ADR 0003 — Three-service pipeline: Media → Authoring → Render\n  ADR 0004 — Tool-use authoring loop with bounded op budget\n  ADR 0007 — Vision adapter: sighted vs blind LLM clients (consult_placement)","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":100051,"version":1,"versionNonce":100052,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}

